ilder where your goal is to build an interstellar industrial empire. Collect resources, automate production, and expand your fleet of ships in order to survive and leave your mark on the galaxy.","steam_appid":2487190,"support_info":{"email":"support@mainsequencegame.com","url":"mainsequencegame.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}